Source material
---------------

"Realistic Australian Medium Voltage Feeder with Associated Low Voltage
Feeders", CSIRO Data Access Portal, DOI 10.25919/ghnz-bk28. Rights held by
GridQube. Licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Changes made
------------

The LV10_223bus feeder was parsed from OpenDSS into the formats used here
(JSON fixtures and database rows). Solved node voltages were computed from it
with OpenDSS. Customer load and generation profiles from the Ausgrid Solar
Home Electricity Data (CC BY 3.0 AU, (c) Ausgrid) were assigned to the
feeder's connection points. See data/SOURCES.md for the attribution text of
both datasets.

Files outside data/derived/ that carry this licence
---------------------------------------------------

- apps/api/internal/engine/testdata/lv10_*.json (the network, and node voltages solved by OpenDSS)
